#: ../../source/installation.rst:157
msgid ""
"Installing several versions side by side is fine: each one unpacks into "
"its own directory, and the last install wins the ``pc`` and ``partcad`` "
"links. Installing an already installed version replaces it."
msgstr ""
"并排安装多个版本是没有问题的：每个版本都会解压到各自的目录中，而最后一次安装会赢得 ``pc`` 和 ``partcad`` "
"链接的指向。安装一个已经安装过的版本会将其替换。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:161
msgid "Upgrade and uninstall"
msgstr "升级与卸载"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:163
msgid "Upgrading is installing again: re-run the same command."
msgstr "升级就是再安装一次：重新运行相同的命令即可。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:169
msgid ""
"Uninstalling removes the bundle and the two links, and only the links "
"that point at the bundle, so a ``pc`` installed from a wheel is left "
"alone. The PartCAD cache and configuration in ``~/.partcad`` are kept; "
"delete that directory as well to leave nothing behind."
msgstr ""
"卸载会移除该捆绑包和那两个链接，但只会移除指向该捆绑包的链接，因此从 wheel 包安装的 ``pc`` 不会受影响。位于 "
"``~/.partcad`` 中的 PartCAD 缓存和配置会被保留；如果想不留下任何残余，也请一并删除该目录。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:174
msgid "Installing a development build"
msgstr "安装开发版本"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:176
msgid ""
"The installer is a file in the repository, so any branch, tag, or pull "
"request has its own copy of it, and the URL selects which one runs. To "
"install using the script as it exists on the ``devel`` branch:"
msgstr ""
"安装程序是仓库中的一个文件，因此任何分支、标签或 pull request 都拥有它各自的副本，而 URL 决定了运行的是哪一个。要使用 "
"``devel`` 分支上现有的脚本进行安装："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:183
msgid "For a pull request, use the branch it comes from, or its head commit:"
msgstr "对于 pull request，请使用它所来自的分支，或其头部提交（head commit）："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:191
msgid ""
"The URL only decides which *installer* runs. By default that installer "
"still downloads the bundle of the latest release, because bundles are "
"published per release, not per commit. To install the bundle a branch or "
"pull request actually built, take it from the ``Standalone`` workflow run"
" of that branch or pull request: open the run on GitHub, download the "
"``partcad-standalone-<platform>`` artifact, unzip it, and point the "
"installer at the directory holding the archive."
msgstr ""
"URL 只决定运行的是哪个 *安装程序* "
"。默认情况下，该安装程序仍会下载最新发布版本的捆绑包，因为捆绑包是按发布版本发布的，而不是按每次提交发布的。要安装某个分支或 pull "
"request 实际构建出的捆绑包，请从该分支或 pull request 的 ``Standalone`` 工作流运行中获取它：在 GitHub"
" 上打开该次运行，下载 ``partcad-standalone-<platform>`` "
"制品，将其解压，然后让安装程序指向存放该归档文件的目录。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:203
msgid ""
"``--base-url`` accepts any URL, so a bundle published anywhere else (an "
"internal mirror, a file server) installs the same way."
msgstr "``--base-url`` 接受任意 URL，因此发布在其他任何位置（内部镜像、文件服务器）的捆绑包也能以同样的方式安装。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:209
msgid "Manual installation"
msgstr "手动安装"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:211
msgid ""
"The archives are attached to every `GitHub release "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad/releases>`_ next to the wheels, "
"together with a ``.sha256`` file each:"
msgstr ""
"这些归档文件与 wheel 包一起，附加在每一个 `GitHub 发布版本 "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad/releases>`_ 中，并且每个归档文件都附带一个 "
"``.sha256`` 文件："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:214
msgid "``partcad-<version>-linux-x86_64.tar.gz``"
msgstr "``partcad-<version>-linux-x86_64.tar.gz``"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:215
msgid "``partcad-<version>-macos-arm64.tar.gz``"
msgstr "``partcad-<version>-macos-arm64.tar.gz``"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:216
msgid "``partcad-<version>-windows-x86_64.zip``"
msgstr "``partcad-<version>-windows-x86_64.zip``"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:218
msgid ""
"Each one unpacks into a single ``partcad/`` directory holding ``pc``, "
"``partcad``, and everything they need. Put that directory anywhere and "
"run the commands from it, or add it to ``PATH``. On Windows, unpack the "
"``.zip`` and add the resulting directory to ``PATH`` -- there is no shell"
" script installer for Windows."
msgstr ""
"每个归档文件都会解压成一个单独的 ``partcad/`` 目录，其中包含 ``pc`` 、 ``partcad`` "
"以及它们所需的一切。你可以把该目录放在任何位置并从中运行命令，或者将其添加到 ``PATH`` 中。在 Windows 上，请解压 "
"``.zip`` 并将解压得到的目录添加到 ``PATH`` 中 —— Windows 没有 shell 脚本安装程序。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:229
msgid ""
"On MacOS, downloading the archive with a browser marks it as quarantined,"
" and Gatekeeper then refuses to run the unpacked commands. Installing "
"with ``install.sh``, or downloading with ``curl``, avoids that. To clear "
"it after the fact: ``xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine <directory>``."
msgstr ""
"在 MacOS 上，用浏览器下载该归档文件会将其标记为已隔离（quarantined），随后 Gatekeeper 会拒绝运行解压出来的命令。使用"
" ``install.sh`` 安装，或使用 ``curl`` 下载，可以避免这一问题。若要事后清除该标记： ``xattr -dr "
"com.apple.quarantine <directory>`` 。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:234
msgid "What is included, and what is not"
msgstr "包含哪些内容，不包含哪些内容"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:236
msgid ""
"The bundle carries everything the wheels would install, including the "
"optional extras that the wheels leave to the user: all the AI providers "
"(``ai-google``, ``ai-openai``, ``ai-ollama``) and the Python linter "
"(``lint``). A frozen bundle cannot be extended afterwards, so it ships "
"complete."
msgstr ""
"该捆绑包携带了 wheel 包会安装的一切内容，包括那些 wheel 包留给用户自行选择的可选附加项（extras）：所有 AI 提供方（ "
"``ai-google`` 、 ``ai-openai`` 、 ``ai-ollama`` ）以及 Python 代码检查器（ ``lint`` "
"）。冻结的捆绑包在事后无法再扩展，因此它以完整的形式发布。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:240
msgid ""
"On Linux and Windows it also carries **OpenSCAD**, which PartCAD runs as "
"an external program to build ``.scad`` parts. The bundled copy is used in"
" preference to any OpenSCAD installed on the machine, so that the bundle "
"behaves the same everywhere rather than depending on which version a "
"given host happens to have. Two consequences worth knowing:"
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 和 Windows 上，它还携带了 **OpenSCAD** ，PartCAD 会将其作为外部程序来运行，以构建 "
"``.scad`` 零件。相比机器上已安装的任何 "
"OpenSCAD，会优先使用捆绑的这一份，这样捆绑包在任何地方的行为都保持一致，而不取决于某台主机恰好安装了哪个版本。有两点后果值得了解："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:245
msgid ""
"A newer OpenSCAD installed on the machine is *not* used by default. To "
"use the host's OpenSCAD instead of the bundled one, pass ``--ignore-"
"bundled-openscad`` or set ``IGNORE_BUNDLED_OPENSCAD=1`` in the "
"environment. (Outside the standalone build there is no bundled OpenSCAD, "
"so the option does nothing.)"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，机器上安装的更新版 OpenSCAD *不会* 被使用。要使用主机上的 OpenSCAD 而非捆绑的那一份，请传入 "
"``--ignore-bundled-openscad`` ，或在环境中设置 ``IGNORE_BUNDLED_OPENSCAD=1`` "
"。（在独立构建版本之外并不存在捆绑的 OpenSCAD，因此该选项不起任何作用。）"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:248
msgid ""
"On Linux the bundled OpenSCAD is the upstream AppImage, which resolves a "
"few libraries from the host (``libGL``, ``libX11``, ``libxcb``, "
"``fontconfig``, ``freetype``, ``glib``, ``harfbuzz``). Desktop "
"installations have these; a stripped-down container or a minimal server "
"may not, and there the bundled OpenSCAD will not start -- pass "
"``--ignore-bundled-openscad`` to fall back to a host OpenSCAD if you have"
" one."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 上，捆绑的 OpenSCAD 是上游的 AppImage，它会从主机解析出少数几个库（ ``libGL`` 、 "
"``libX11`` 、 ``libxcb`` 、 ``fontconfig`` 、 ``freetype`` 、 ``glib`` 、 "
"``harfbuzz`` ）。桌面环境的安装通常具备这些库；而精简过的容器或最小化的服务器可能没有，此时捆绑的 OpenSCAD 将无法启动 ——"
" 如果你有主机上的 OpenSCAD，可以传入 ``--ignore-bundled-openscad`` 来回退到它。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:254
msgid ""
"The macOS bundle carries no OpenSCAD: the last OpenSCAD release predates "
"Apple silicon and ships an Intel-only build, which would quietly require "
"Rosetta 2. On macOS, install OpenSCAD yourself and PartCAD will use it."
msgstr ""
"macOS 的捆绑包不携带 OpenSCAD：OpenSCAD 的最后一个发布版本早于 Apple 芯片，只提供仅支持 Intel "
"的构建，这会悄悄地需要 Rosetta 2。在 macOS 上，请自行安装 OpenSCAD，PartCAD 便会使用它。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:258
msgid ""
"Two other things are deliberately not in the bundle, because PartCAD runs"
" them as external programs rather than importing them, exactly as the "
"wheels do:"
msgstr "还有另外两样东西是故意不放进捆绑包的，因为 PartCAD 是将它们作为外部程序来运行、而不是导入它们，这与 wheel 包的做法完全相同："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:261
msgid "**git**, used to fetch package repositories."
msgstr "**git** ，用于获取包仓库。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:262
msgid ""
"**conda** (or **mamba**), used to build the sandbox in which PartCAD runs"
" CAD scripts."
msgstr "**conda** （或 **mamba** ），用于构建 PartCAD 运行 CAD 脚本所在的沙箱。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:264
msgid "Run ``pc healthcheck`` to see what is missing on the current machine."
msgstr "运行 ``pc healthcheck`` 可以查看当前机器上缺少了哪些东西。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:266
msgid ""
"The bundle provides the command line tools only. The ``partcad`` Python "
"module for CAD-as-code scripts is a wheel: ``python -m pip install -U "
"partcad``."
msgstr ""
"该捆绑包仅提供命令行工具。用于代码化 CAD 脚本的 ``partcad`` Python 模块是一个 wheel 包： ``python -m "
"pip install -U partcad`` 。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:272
msgid "Latest Development Version of PartCAD"
msgstr "PartCAD 的最新开发版本"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:274
msgid ""
"You can install the latest development version of PartCAD from the "
"``devel`` branch on `PartCAD <https://github.com/partcad/partcad>`_. "
"First, create an isolated Python environment, and ensure ``pip``, "
"``setuptools``, and ``wheel`` are upgraded, then follow the instructions "
"below to install the core module and the CLI tool."
msgstr ""
"你可以从 `PartCAD <https://github.com/partcad/partcad>`_ 上的 ``devel`` 分支安装 "
"PartCAD 的最新开发版本。首先，创建一个隔离的 Python 环境，并确保 ``pip`` 、 ``setuptools`` 和 "
"``wheel`` 均已升级，然后按照下面的说明安装核心模块和 CLI 工具。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:279
msgid "**Install or upgrade the Core Python Module**"
msgstr "**安装或升级核心 Python 模块**"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:285
msgid "**Install or upgrade the CLI**"
msgstr "**安装或升级 CLI**"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:293
msgid "Python module"
msgstr "Python 模块"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:295
msgid ""
"PartCAD provides Python modules that can be used in CAD as code scripts "
"(such as ``CadQuery``, ``build123d`` and ``sdf``). It's a dependency of "
"``partcad-cli`` so it doesn't usually need to be installed separately."
msgstr ""
"PartCAD 提供了可在代码化 CAD 脚本（例如 ``CadQuery`` 、 ``build123d`` 和 ``sdf`` ）中使用的 "
"Python 模块。它是 ``partcad-cli`` 的一个依赖，因此通常不需要单独安装。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:309
msgid "AI providers"
msgstr "AI 提供方"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:311
msgid ""
"The SDKs of the supported AI providers are optional. Install the extra "
"that matches the provider you intend to use, either on ``partcad-cli``:"
msgstr ""
"受支持的各 AI 提供方的 SDK 是可选的。请安装与你打算使用的提供方相匹配的附加项（extra），既可以安装到 ``partcad-cli``"
" 上："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:321
msgid "or on ``partcad`` itself, using the same extra names:"
msgstr "也可以使用相同的附加项名称，安装到 ``partcad`` 本身上："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:327
msgid ""
"Without the matching extra, using an AI provider fails with an error "
"naming the package to install. Everything else in PartCAD works without "
"them."
msgstr ""
"如果没有安装相匹配的附加项，使用某个 AI 提供方时会失败，并报出需要安装哪个包的错误。PartCAD "
"中的其他一切功能在没有它们的情况下也都能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:332
msgid "Linting"
msgstr "代码检查（Linting）"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:334
msgid ""
"The linter used by ``pc lint`` to check Python files is optional. Install"
" the ``lint`` extra to enable it, either on ``partcad-cli``:"
msgstr ""
"``pc lint`` 用于检查 Python 文件的代码检查器是可选的。请安装 ``lint`` 附加项来启用它，既可以安装到 "
"``partcad-cli`` 上："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:341
msgid "or on ``partcad`` itself, using the same extra name:"
msgstr "也可以使用相同的附加项名称，安装到 ``partcad`` 本身上："

#: ../../source/installation.rst:347
msgid ""
"Without the extra, linting Python files reports an error naming the "
"package to install. Everything else in PartCAD, including linting of YAML"
" files, works without it."
msgstr ""
"如果没有安装该附加项，对 Python 文件进行代码检查时会报出需要安装哪个包的错误。PartCAD 中的其他一切功能（包括对 YAML "
"文件的代码检查）在没有它的情况下也都能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:353
msgid "Visual Studio Code extension"
msgstr "Visual Studio Code 扩展"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:355
msgid ""
"This extension is available through the VS Code marketplace. The "
"corresponding marketplace page is `here "
"<https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=OpenVMP.partcad>`_."
msgstr ""
"此扩展可通过 VS Code 市场获取。对应的市场页面在 `此处 "
"<https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=OpenVMP.partcad>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:360
msgid "Public PartCAD repository"
msgstr "公共 PartCAD 仓库"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:362
msgid ""
"The public PartCAD repository is hosted at `GitHub "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad-index>`_. If necessary, PartCAD tools"
" are automatically retrieving the contents of this repository and all "
"other required repositories and packages. No manual action is needed to "
"`install` it."
msgstr ""
"公共 PartCAD 仓库托管在 `GitHub <https://github.com/partcad/partcad-index>`_ "
"上。必要时，PartCAD 工具会自动获取该仓库以及所有其他所需仓库和包的内容。无需任何手动操作即可 `安装` 它。"

#: ../../source/installation.rst:366
msgid ""
"However, if you suspect that something is wrong with locally cached "
"files, use ``pc system status`` to investigate and to determine the "
"location of the cached files."
msgstr "不过，如果你怀疑本地缓存的文件出了什么问题，可以使用 ``pc system status`` 来排查，并确定缓存文件所在的位置。"
